parts.text:
Also `adminLogout` (line ~625) sets role back to 'user' — with adoption, logout should restore guest instead:

```ts
const adminLogout = () => {
  setAdminToken(null);
  safeStorage.set(STORAGE_KEYS.ADMIN_TOKEN, '');
  setCurrentUser((prev) => ({ ...prev, role: 'user' }));
  navigateTo('/');
};
```

Since the current user IS admin_master after adoption, `{...prev, role:'user'}` would leave a demoted admin_master profile persisted — and the startup scrub would then reset it anyway. Cleaner: on logout, if prev is the universal admin profile, revert to GUEST_USER.

